<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:sparkle="http://www.andymatuschak.org/xml-namespaces/sparkle"><channel><title>Off the Menu</title><link>https://fourgeailabs.github.io/appcast-android.xml</link><description>Off the Menu updates</description><language>en</language><item><title>Version 2.3.2</title><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 16:30:00 +0000</pubDate><sparkle:version>2.3.2</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>2.3.2</sparkle:shortVersionString><description>Android fix release: if a launch ever fails to reach the menu, the game now repairs itself on the next launches - first by clearing its shader and log caches, then its update status, and as a last resort by resetting to defaults with your herd, records and settings preserved in a rescue backup - instead of dying at 1% loading until the app data is cleared by hand.</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/fourgeailabs/fourgeailabs.github.io/releases/download/v2.3.2/OffTheMenu-Android.apk" length="161695855" type="application/vnd.android.package-archive" sparkle:edSignature=""/></item></channel></rss>